tmp=!trim a bijective,	a continuous, \strong,	a continuous and bijective,	a continuous and differentiable,	a continuous and periodic,	an increasing,	an increasing and periodic,	an increasing and surjective,	a decreasing,	a decreasing and periodic,	a decreasing and surjective,	an odd,	an odd and increasing,	an odd and decreasing,	an injective,	an even,	an even and increasing,	an even and decreasing,	a periodic,	a strictly increasing,	a strictly decreasing	
val8=!translate internal $	\
$ to ;; in $tmp
